sequenceDiagram
actor Main
participant F as RentalFacade
participant B as RentalBuilder
participant R as BaseRental
participant P as PricingStrategy
Note over Main,F: Vehicle already registered using a concrete VehicleFactory
Main->>F: rentVehicle(id, customer, vehicleId, hours, strategy, extras, promo, notes)
F->>F: Normalize IDs&#59; reject duplicates, unknown or unavailable vehicle
F->>B: new RentalBuilder()
F->>B: withRentalId(...).withCustomerName(...).withVehicle(...)
F->>B: withDurationHours(...).withPricingStrategy(...)
F->>B: withPromoCode(...).withNotes(...)
F->>B: build()
B->>B: Validate required values
B->>R: new BaseRental(validated values)
R-->>B: BaseRental
B-->>F: Rental
Note over F,R: Facade wraps extras with RentalDecorator implementations when selected
F->>F: Set vehicle unavailable&#59; store active rental
F->>R: calculateTotalPrice() (through decorators if selected)
R->>P: calculatePrice(vehicle, hours)
P-->>R: base tariff
R->>R: Apply AITU10 discount if supplied
R-->>F: rental total (including extras when wrapped)
Note over F: Publish VEHICLE_RENTED through AvailabilityPublisher to subscribed listeners
F-->>Main: Rental
Note over Main,P: Simplified happy path. Validation errors stop before creation&#59; listener exceptions can propagate after state changes.